.TH DANBY-DISCUS 1
.SH NAME
danby-discus \- aerodynamic path of a discus
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B danby/discus
.SH MODEL
The planar flight combines gravity, quadratic drag, and lift controlled by the
disc attitude.  Changing attitude exposes the tradeoff between supporting lift
and aerodynamic loading.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/plugin/discus.b
